  "$comment": [
    "CW Dungeon (#186, #170), pinned for both ports: DungeonGame / DungeonSpells",
    "in ios/Sources/MorseKit/Dungeon.swift and android/.../morsekit/Dungeon.kt.",
    "Read by ios/Sources/MorseKitCheck/main.swift and",
    "android/app/src/test/.../morsekit/DungeonTest.kt.",
    "",
    "Every expected value below was worked out from the rules in 'derivation',",
    "not captured from either port. Do not regenerate it to make a failing test",
    "pass; change it only when a rule is meant to change."
  ],
  "derivation": {
    "rules": [
      "A monster casts a spell word in Morse; the learner keys the counter word",
      "before the attack window closes. The window opens when the spell has",
      "finished sounding: the attack lands at sendSeconds + window after the cast.",
      "  sendSeconds = PARIS timing of the word at the ramp's current speed:",
      "    dit 1, dah 3, element gap 1, character gap 3 units, unit = 1.2 / WPM s",
      "    (Farnsworth, when set, stretches the character gap as MorseTiming does;",
      "    the rows below are standard timing).",
      "  window(room) = max(minWindow, baseWindow * windowDecay^(room-1)) * timeScale",
      "    with the Invaders difficulty scale: relaxed 1.35, normal 1, fast 0.75.",
      "The first cast comes castDelay after the game starts and castDelay after",
      "each resolution; a cleared room waits roomDelay before its first cast.",
      "A correct counter scores pointsPerHit * multiplier(combo) and takes one",
      "hit off the casting monster; multiplier = min(4, 1 + (combo-1)/3), the",
      "Invaders rule. A heal spell countered also restores one life, up to the",
      "starting lives. A wrong or late counter costs a life and resets the combo.",
      "When every monster in the room is down the room is cleared: +roomClearBonus,",
      "and the next room is entered. Rooms 1-2 hold one monster, later rooms two,",
      "each taking hitsPerMonster hits; every bossEvery-th room holds one dragon",
      "taking bossHits. Regular kinds cycle slime, bat, skeleton, ghost by room.",
      "Speed ramp: a game opens startOffset WPM under the character speed, never",
      "under minWpm; every hitsPerStep hits in total steps up 'step' WPM to the",
      "character speed; a hit taken steps down 'step', never under the start.",
      "Spell pools: a spell is available when every letter of its pair is in the",
      "active set (case-insensitive). Fewer than minPool available falls back to",
      "the first starterCount spells of the list, flagged 'fallback'. The list is",
      "ordered by the latest Koch letter each pair needs.",
      "characterOutcomes pairs each expected character with the keyed one at the",
      "same position (null when nothing was keyed there); extra keyed characters",
      "are ignored."
    ],
    "pointsPerHit": 100,
    "roomClearBonus": 250,
    "hitsPerMonster": 2,
    "bossEvery": 5,
    "bossHits": 4,
    "lives": 3,
    "baseWindow": 6.0,
    "windowDecay": 0.92,
    "minWindow": 2.5,
    "castDelay": 1.0,
    "roomDelay": 2.0,
    "minWpm": 15,
    "startOffset": 8,
    "step": 1,
    "hitsPerStep": 4,
    "starterCount": 4,
    "minPool": 3
  },
